  "label": "Anti-Latino/Hispanic Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Latino and Hispanic immigrants are 'illegal immigrants' who 'take land' and are portrayed as invaders. This stereotype is rooted in real-world xenophobic and racist tropes targeting Latino communities, often used to justify exclusionary policies and promote hostile attitudes toward immigrants. The image uses animals to represent these groups, but the underlying message is tied to real-world racial and ethnic prejudice.",
